[{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0340","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0340.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0764","title":"Juergen Schoenwaelder scotty ntping 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"该漏洞存在于 Juergen Schoenwaelder 开发的 scotty 2.1.x 协议监测工具中，其 ntping 子功能在处理用户输入的主机名时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当攻击者向 ntping 提供异常长的主机名作为命令行参数时，程序分配的缓冲区将不足以存储输入数据，导致栈缓冲区溢出。攻击者可以利用这一溢出overwrite返回地址，栽入shellcode并执行任意代码，实现在目标主机上的本地权限提升和代码执行。该漏洞影响 scotty 2.1.0 及更早版本用户，攻击者无需身份验证，只需提供精心构造的长主机名即可触发漏洞。尽管 CVSS 评分显示其攻击复杂性较低，但一旦触发则会导致完全 compromise，安全影响等级为 HIGH 级别的严重问题。微软/项目维护者已发布安全补丁，建议用户升级到 scotty 2.1.1 及以上版本以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0764"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:54Z","remediation":"建议升级 scotty 到 2.1.1 或更高版本（已修复 ntping 缓冲区溢出），或从源码重新编译并启用栈保护（-fstack-protector）。若无法升级，建议删除或限制 ntping 二进制文件执行权限（chmod 700 /usr/bin/ntping），仅允许 root 执行，并限制本地用户登录权限作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2001-q2/0579.html","http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/vuln-dev/2001-q2/0627.html","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_023_scotty_txt.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192664","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2911","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6735","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20960","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0764.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0764","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0764.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0764.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-428r-jfg5-x94p/GHSA-428r-jfg5-x94p.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0764.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--9d19d8f3-2a12-47fc-a172-34a0bab60a28.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0764.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0340.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0337","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0337.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0762","title":"kosch suid wrapper 1.1.1 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"kosch suid wrapper 1.1.1 版本的 su-wrapper 程序存在本地缓冲区溢出漏洞，由于对第一个命令行参数长度缺乏边界检查，本地攻击者可传入超长参数导致栈缓冲区溢出，覆盖返回地址并执行任意 Shellcode，从而以 su-wrapper 的特权（通常为 root）执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 kosch suid wrapper 1.1.1 版本，攻击条件为已获得本地普通用户权限，利用方式为构造超长参数触发溢出实现权限提升，CVSS 评分 4.6（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:P/A:P），属于本地权限提升类漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0762"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:54Z","remediation":"建议立即卸载或升级 kosch suid wrapper 1.1.1 至最新版本（建议迁移至 sudo 等现代 sudo 替代品），或使用 chmod u-s /usr/bin/su-wrapper 移除 suid 位禁用该程序的 setuid 权限作为临时缓解。若必须保留，请启用内核栈保护（/proc/sys/kernel/stack_guard_page=1）并开启 ASLR（echo 2 > /proc/sys/kernel/randomize_va_space）缓解缓冲区溢出利用，同时限制该程序仅允许特定用户组执行（chmod 750 /usr/bin/su-wrapper && chgrp wheel /usr/bin/su-wrapper）。建议优先迁移至维护中的 sudo 或 doas 替代该老旧 suid wrapper。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0057.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20906","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0762.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0762","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0762.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0762.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jpw5-m4fc-7qm3/GHSA-jpw5-m4fc-7qm3.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0762.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt","https://github.com/dong-xs/Vul-PAG/blob/7eb3b32094a5270cfd8495366e0e4a7df5a874ce/aspect_prediction/org_pred_diff.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0337.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0336","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0336.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0760","title":"Citrix Nfuse 1.51 Web根目录泄露漏洞","description":"Citrix Nfuse 1.51 存在 Web 根目录路径泄露漏洞，攻击者可向 launch.asp 发送缺少 session 字段的畸形请求，导致服务器在错误响应中泄露 Web 根目录的绝对路径。该漏洞影响 Citrix Nfuse 1.51 版本，CVSS 评分 5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:P/I:N/A:N），属于中危信息泄露漏洞。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程发起攻击，通过构造畸形 HTTP 请求获取服务器 Web 根目录绝对路径，进而辅助后续攻击如路径遍历、文件包含等漏洞利用。Citrix 已发布补丁修复该漏洞，建议升级至修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0760"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:54Z","remediation":"建议升级到 Citrix Nfuse 1.52 或更高版本（如 Citrix Presentation Server 4.0 及以上），该版本已修复 launch.asp 会话字段缺失导致的 Web 路径泄露漏洞。若暂时无法升级，可在 Web 服务器（IIS）层面配置 URL 扫描规则拦截缺少 session 参数的 launch.asp 请求，或在 ISAPI 过滤器中拦截不带 session 字段的请求，同时在 IIS 中禁用详细错误信息返回以防止路径泄露。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/194449","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/194522","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2956","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6786","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20987","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0760.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0760","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0760.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0760.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4g4h-9c64-2wvp/GHSA-4g4h-9c64-2wvp.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0760.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0760.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--75587605-3cde-46a5-9b2b-d8651fda8954.json","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--75587605-3cde-46a5-9b2b-d8651fda8954.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0336.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0336.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0336.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0334","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0334.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0759","title":"Jetico BestCrypt BCTool UMount 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Jetico BestCrypt 0.6、0.7、0.8 及 0.8.1 及更早版本中的 bctool 工具存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。该工具在执行卸载加密卷（umount）操作时，会对文件或目录的路径名进行处理，但未对路径名长度进行充分的边界检查，导致栈上缓冲区溢出，攻击者可在栈上覆盖关键变量并劫持程序执行流程。本地攻击者可通过构造包含特制长路径名的文件或目录，在系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制目标主机。该漏洞利用门槛极低，无需身份认证，攻击者可利用公开可获取的 PoC 利用代码，通过创建含 shellcode 的深层目录路径，调用 bctool umount 命令触发溢出并获得 root shell。受影响的系统包括安装了上述版本 BestCrypt 的 Linux 主机，CVSS 评分为 7.2，危害等级为高危。Jetico 已在后续版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户升级到最新版本并限制本地未授权用户的访问权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0759"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:54Z","remediation":"升级到支持路径长度限制的最佳版本如 BestCrypt 0.8.2 或更高版本。配置 BCTool 时启用路径长度验证，限制最大路径长度为 255 字节。如无法立即升级，可在权限控制中限制普通用户执行 UMount 操作，并启用路径长度检查功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/191111","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2875","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20927","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0759.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0759","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0759.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0759.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g9ch-8fx3-4rwr/GHSA-g9ch-8fx3-4rwr.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0759.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/a036095fb2c093f3863681adc5999690c37b930e/nvdcve/CVE-2001-0759.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2875/info.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0334.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0332","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0332.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0748","title":"Acme Serve 1.7 任意文件访问漏洞","description":"Acme.Serve 1.7 存在URI处理缺陷，攻击者可通过向URI头部添加多个斜杠（\"/\"）字符，绕过路径验证机制，从而读取目标系统中任意文件。该漏洞影响 Cisco Secure ACS Unix 及某些其它使用 Acme.Serve 1.7 的产品，允许未经身份验证的远程攻击者访问敏感文件，如系统配置文件、密码文件、数据库文件等，窃取机密信息。攻击者只需发送构造恶意的HTTP请求，即可利用该漏洞在目标服务器上执行任意文件读取操作，威胁系统数据安全。基于 CVSS V2 评分为 5.0，攻击复杂度低，评估风险等级为中度，尽管其仅影响保密性，但可能导致严重信息泄露，尤其在涉及企业核心数据的应用系统中更为危险。该漏洞早先公布于 2001 年 10 月，至今仍有大量系统中未安装相关安全补丁，攻击风险不容忽视。（生成自CVE-2001-0748标准化数据集）","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0748"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:53Z","remediation":"Acme.Serve 1.7 版本存在目录遍历漏洞，直接导致任意文件读取。建议立即更新到最新安全版本（需查阅厂商最新补丁或官方版本），或使用路径验证中间件处理用户输入路径；如无法立即更新，可在防火墙/IDS中配置URL路径匹配规则，拦截包含多个连续'/'的前缀路径请求。可以使用Nginx反向代理部署Path 정규化验证，正则表达式:^/[a-zA-Z0-9_-]+[^/]*$，确保URL路径不以多个'/'开头。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.cisco.com/warp/public/707/acmeweb-acsunix-dirtravers-vuln-pub.shtml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6634.php","http://www.osvdb.org/5544","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/188141","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2809","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20894","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0748.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0748.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0748","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1ea1fd4e9132e508aaecde8cf383b74de1fcf0a5/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0748.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0748.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-f374-v37m-vrcw/GHSA-f374-v37m-vrcw.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x3000/2809/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0748.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--cd8d89a3-84e8-4b7d-a1fe-c609fe2a7db6.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0332.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0332.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0332.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0328","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0328.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0746","title":"iPlanet Web Server Enterprise Edition 4.1 Web Publisher 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Sun iPlanet Web Server Enterprise Edition 4.1 及更早版本的 Web Publisher 模块存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。远程未经身份认证的攻击者可通过发送包含超长 URI 的 GETPROPERTIES、GETATTRIBUTENAMES 或其他 WebDAV 方法请求，触发缓冲区溢出，导致服务拒绝并可能实现远程任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 iPlanet Web Server Enterprise Edition 4.1 及更早版本，攻击向量为网络远程、低攻击复杂度、无需认证，CVSS 评分 10.0（严重），可导致系统完全失陷。攻击者只需发送精心构造的超长 URI 请求即可触发漏洞，公开 Exploit 代码已存在（ExploitDB-20853 等）。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0746"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:52Z","remediation":"建议立即使用 Oracle HTTP Server (OHS) 或 Apache 等受支持的Web服务器，完全迁移旧版iPlanet Web Server Enterprise Edition。请先联系Sun/Oracle获取最新的安全补丁包或支持服务协议。如果无法即时更换，建议立即关闭Web Publisher模块服务，并通过防火墙限制对服务的网络访问，同时将Web服务器的URI长度限制设置为不超过8KB，最大头部大小限制为4KB，以缓解缓冲区溢出风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0132.html","http://iplanet.com/products/iplanet_web_enterprise/iwsalert5.11.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2732","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6554","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20853","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0746.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0746.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0746","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/115c94bd1da3cc18977d652d6e78c9f4a5dfc13b/data/year/2001.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0746.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0746.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jqcv-2ph4-7vv9/GHSA-jqcv-2ph4-7vv9.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0328.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0328.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0328.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0326","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0326.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0743","title":"O'Reilly Software WebBoard Pager 4.10.30 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"这是一个 O'Reilly WebBoard 软件的Pager功能严重输入验证漏洞。当用户发送消息时，系统未能对单引号字符进行正确转义，从而允许攻击者注入JavaScript代码。远程未认证攻击者可通过发送包含恶意脚本的messag实现漏洞利用，导致WebBoard应用崩溃或拒绝服务，影响论坛正常运行。这一漏洞主要影响 O'Reilly WebBoard 4.10 及更早版本，对在线社区造成严重威胁，攻击者可轻易破坏论坛系统的可用性和稳定性。漏洞利用方式是向目标系统发送特制的消息，攻击者无需任何权限即可触发服务可用性问题，进而影响在线社区的用户体验和数据管理可靠性。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0743"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:52Z","remediation":"立即升级到 WebBoard 5.x 或更高版本（当前已修复漏洞），或切换到受支持的替代方案如 phpBB、Discourse 等开源论坛系统。如果无法立即升级，可停用 WebBoard服务或通过防火墙过滤包含单引号和JavaScript命令的HTTP请求以临时缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0326.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2814","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20896","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0743.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0743","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0743.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0743.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-9rw7-2gcj-3x9m/GHSA-9rw7-2gcj-3x9m.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0743.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_5.list.dict","https://github.com/akabe1/windows_exploit_dowser/blob/11b24e36173cd382721db28581e575faf687d06b/cve_from_exploitdb_website.csv"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0326.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0326.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0326.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0323","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0323.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0741","title":"思科 HSRP 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Cisco HSRP（热备路由协议）存在拒绝服务漏洞，源于 HSRP 协议未对数据包来源进行有效身份验证。本地攻击者可在同一广播域内伪造伪造的 HSRP 数据包，冒充活跃路由器发送优先级更高的 Hello 包，导致备份路由器频繁抢占主备状态，引发路由震荡并导致网络服务中断。该漏洞影响运行 HSRP 协议的 Cisco 路由器及三层交换机，攻击者需具备本地网络访问权限（同一二层网段），通过发送伪造优先级为 255 的 HSRP 数据包即可触发主备切换风暴，导致网络拓扑不稳定并造成拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 2.1（AV:L/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），属本地低危漏洞，Cisco 已发布补丁修复该漏洞。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0741"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:52Z","remediation":"升级到支持 HSRP 认证的 Cisco IOS 版本，并配置强密码认证。配置独立型 HSRP 认证（type 7 或 type 0 明文方式），同时限制 HSRP 报文源 IP 验证。禁用本端已知危险的 HSRP 配置，如使用了不安全的认证或未启用的端口后监听。实施 HSRP 流量过滤，确保只能从信任网段发送 HSRP 报文，以防止中间人攻击。定期检查 IOS 软件补丁和安全公告，及时应用 Cisco 发布的 HSRP 安全更新。重新启动设备后验证 HSRP 状态，确保协议已正确配置和运行。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0035.html","http://www.cisco.com/networkers/nw00/pres/2402.pdf","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2684","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6497","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20821","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0741.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0741","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0741.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/c52ac29e3e33d673083c7aada18d2fe25f185ca8/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0741.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-fvq6-58cc-f6vv/GHSA-fvq6-58cc-f6vv.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0741.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0741.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_4.list.dict"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0323.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0321","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0321.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0740","title":"3Com OfficeConnect DSL 路由器 812/840 HTTP 端口格式化字符串拒绝服务漏洞","description":"3Com OfficeConnect DSL Router 812/840 ADSL路由器4.2版本（运行OCR812路由器软件1.1.9及更早版本）的HTTP服务端口存在格式化字符串漏洞。远程未授权攻击者可通过向HTTP端口发送包含大量\"%s\"格式化字符串的超长字符串，触发格式化字符串漏洞导致路由器拒绝服务。该漏洞影响3Com OfficeConnect 812和840 ADSL路由器产品，CVSS评分5.0（AV:N/AC:L/Au:N/C:N/I:N/A:P），攻击向量为网络、攻击复杂度低、无需认证、仅影响可用性。攻击者只需向目标路由器HTTP端口发送包含大量\"%s\"格式化说明符的恶意HTTP请求即可触发漏洞导致设备拒绝服务，ExploitDB编号20847提供了公开利用代码。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0740"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 3Com OfficeConnect DSL Router 812/840 的 OCR812 路由器软件至 1.1.10 或更高版本（如已停产无法升级，建议更换设备）。临时缓解措施：在防火墙层面限制 HTTP 管理端口（默认 80 端口）仅允许受信管理 IP 访问，或在边界防火墙拦截包含大量 \"%s\" 格式化字符串的异常 HTTP 请求。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-05/0115.html","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100119572524232&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=100137290421828&w=2","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2721","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6573","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20847","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0740.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0740.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0740","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0740.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2001/CVE-2001-0740.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-4fm7-gv4j-hx3r/GHSA-4fm7-gv4j-hx3r.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0740.json","https://github.com/magicsword-io/Magic-SigExplorer/blob/2c28b91b003429a144a687199ee99ebd26f1a343/Magic-SigExplorer/docs/cve_report.md","https://github.com/andreafioraldi/ToolsForCyberChallenge/blob/197d3dfd204cf1b9d1af1451455c8831c3ff9948/generated/files_3.list.dict","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--612e8e5b-ac67-42c5-9622-6290e7c9d043.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0321.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0315","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0315.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0787","title":"LPRng 打印系统 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"LPRng 打印守护进程在初始化降低权限时未能正确丢弃继承的补充组（supplementary groups）成员关系，导致守护进程及其所有子进程仍保留启动 LPRng 时获得的补充组权限。攻击者可在受影响系统上利用此缺陷提升本地权限。具体而言，运行权限已被降低的进程或例程仍带有补充组权限，若 LPRng 同时存在其他易受攻击的代码路径，攻击者可通过 tmp 文件处理不当等漏洞修改 lp 用户配置文件，进而将恶意代码注入由主打印过滤器执行的配置文件中，最终以 lp 用户或 root 身份执行任意命令。该漏洞影响 Red Hat Linux 7.0 和 7.1 上 LPRng 3.6.x 至 3.7.4-23 版本，攻击条件为攻击者拥有目标系统的本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 4.6，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0787"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:57Z","remediation":"对于 Red Hat Linux 7.0 和 7.1 系统，建议立即安装 Red Hat 官方安全公告 RHSA-2001-077 中发布的修复包，将 LPRng 升级至 LPRng-3.7.4-23 或更高版本，并将 tetex 组件升级至 tetex-1.0.7-18 或更高版本。升级前请使用 rpm -q LPRng tetex 确认当前版本，若仍为 LPRng-3.7.4-23 及更早版本或 tetex-1.0.7-7 及更早版本则存在风险。可通过 yum update LPRng tetex 完成升级，升级后重启打印服务 systemctl restart lpd。如暂时无法打补丁，可临时通过 /etc/hosts.deny 限制对 lpc（端口 515）的本地访问，或禁用 LPRng 打印服务以减少攻击面。如业务无需打印服务，可直接执行 systemctl stop lpd && systemctl disable lpd 彻底禁用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-096.shtml","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-077.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2865","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6703","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20923","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/6e1781cc6a314747dfce9d8864a3f090ef8f0a6f/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0787.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0787","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/21f29c262df67f8fba785d468c4552b0e1fc4211/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0787.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/426b24561da5907e2706f7cda3b65ab75123f3ba/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0787.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-8cwj-qxjh-6vq7/GHSA-8cwj-qxjh-6vq7.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/8e78308f58d71d108c659e6e5fc1013cd249713d/content/CVE-2001-0787.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2001/CVE-2001-0787.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151700_151800.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--1958f5cb-f925-490a-ba7a-9d487582a13a.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0315.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0313","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0313.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0784","title":"Xiph.org Icecast 目录遍历漏洞","description":"Icecast 1.3.10 及更早版本存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者可通过在 HTTP 请求中使用编码后的路径穿越字符（如 .. ）构造恶意 URL，绕过服务器路径校验读取服务器上的任意敏感文件。该漏洞无需身份认证，攻击者可利用此缺陷获取配置文件、密码文件等敏感信息，导致信息泄露。Icecast 1.1.x 至 1.3.x 全系列版本均受此漏洞影响，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0784"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:57Z","remediation":"建议将 Icecast 升级至 1.3.11 或更高版本以修复该目录遍历漏洞。对于 Debian 系统用户，可通过 apt 安装 Debian 安全更新 DSA-089 中发布的 icecast-server 1.3.10-1 修复包（执行 apt-get update && apt-get install icecast-server）。如暂时无法升级，可在 Icecast 配置文件中限制 serve 目录的访问范围，或在前端部署反向代理过滤包含 URL 编码字符（如 %2e%2e）的恶意请求，以降低攻击者读取服务器敏感文件的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0353.html","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-089","http://www.osvdb.org/1883","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-105.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2002-063.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2932","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6752","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20972","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/3dd627d6b90f81690ae15e5d5fb02176cc79caf3/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0784.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0784","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0784.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/aa5f2f0cb1791a7f76244bf9f9a0c7e17c4a2f8d/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0784.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-089.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/292f77a8e015ead047ef178a4e7ea4de6f3945c3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-gphh-99vm-m2wj/GHSA-gphh-99vm-m2wj.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/icecast_dir_traversal.nasl","https://github.com/mitre/cti/blob/ea1adfe1a68ca3dcfe2dd883180b8cf10a988824/capec/2.0/attack-pattern/attack-pattern--d859e461-7ca6-46a6-842e-3f1750bc8415.json","https://github.com/DragonFlyBSD/DPorts/blob/e2f31ebea3a06041c3c693a21703388f71fe19de/security/vuxml/vuln/2004.xml","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-089.data"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0313.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0311","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0311.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0763","title":"Xinetd 2.1.8 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Linux xinetd 2.1.8.9pre11-1 及更早版本的 svc_logprint 函数存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送超长的 ident 响应触发缓冲区溢出，导致在目标系统上以 xinetd 进程权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响运行受影响版本 xinetd 的 Linux 系统，CVSS 评分 7.5（高危），攻击向量为网络远程、攻击复杂度低、无需认证，可导致机密性、完整性和可用性均受影响。攻击者无需认证即可远程发送恶意 ident 响应触发漏洞，Debian 已发布 DSA-063 安全公告提供修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0763"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:54Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 xinetd 至 2.1.8.9pre11 之后的版本，或安装各 Linux 发行版提供的安全更新（如 Debian DSA-063 补丁、Red Hat RHSA-2001:063 等）。若暂时无法升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 ident 服务端口（默认 113/tcp）的外部访问，或在 xinetd 配置文件 /etc/xinetd.conf 中禁用 ident 服务作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://archives.neohapsis.com/archives/bugtraq/2001-06/0064.html","http://distro.conectiva.com.br/atualizacoes/?id=a&anuncio=000404","http://download.immunix.org/ImmunixOS/7.0/updates/IMNX-2001-70-024-01","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/l-104.shtml","http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-063","http://www.linuxsecurity.com/advisories/other_advisory-1469.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-075.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2840","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6670","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20908","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/efd7fc726910da5a47b5ea864d60bf92f66b594e/2001/CVE-2001-0763.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0763.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0763","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0763.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-063.nasl","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-vgvr-p7mx-p57j/GHSA-vgvr-p7mx-p57j.json","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0763.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/debiancn/debian.org/blob/6abc98daa6356b20e410013a6920b3764af682d4/english/security/2001/dsa-063.data","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--21a71cac-9a5c-4bf5-94ee-278c427576aa.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0311.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0310","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0310.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0736","title":"华盛顿大学 Pico 文件覆盖漏洞","description":"华盛顿大学 Pico 编辑器 3.x/4.x 版本（随 pine 邮件客户端 4.33 之前版本附带）存在符号链接攻击漏洞，本地用户可通过创建恶意符号链接欺骗 pico 编辑器覆盖任意系统文件。该漏洞源于 pico 编辑器在处理临时文件时未正确验证符号链接，攻击者需具备本地账户访问权限，通过构造指向敏感文件的符号链接，诱导受害者使用 pico 编辑文件时触发覆盖，导致任意文件被篡改，影响系统完整性。CVSS 2.1 分（本地访问、低复杂度、无需认证、部分完整性影响）。受影响版本为 pine 4.33 之前版本及随附的 pico 编辑器 3.x/4.x 版本，升级至 pine 4.33 或更高版本可修复。攻击者需具备本地登录权限，通过构造指向关键系统文件（如 /etc/passwd）的符号链接，诱导用户编辑文件触发漏洞覆盖目标文件。","severity":"LOW","score":2.1,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0736"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:51Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Pine 到 4.33 或更高版本，或升级 Pico 编辑器到修复版本。若无法立即升级，可通过设置环境变量 TMPDIR 指向安全目录，或在启动时使用 -T 选项禁用临时文件创建作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=98749102621604&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=99106787825229&w=2","http://www.linux-mandrake.com/en/security/2001/MDKSA-2001-047.php3?dis=8.0","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-042.html","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6367","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20493","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0736.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0736","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0736.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0736.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-xqxf-jjq4-grw6/GHSA-xqxf-jjq4-grw6.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0736.md","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88831/info.html","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/M/mandrake_MDKSA-2001-047.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3e5a320e-2f07-4765-87c5-3a6cfee675f0.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2001/POC-AVE-2001-0310.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2001/EXP-AVE-2001-0310.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0310.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0107","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0107.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0775","title":"xloadimage xloadimage 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"xloadimage 4.1（又称 xli 1.16 和 1.17）是 Linux 平台上常用的图像查看工具。该工具在处理 FACES 格式图像文件时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，当图像文件中包含过长的 Firstname 或 Lastname 字段时，会触发栈缓冲区溢出。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过网络发送特制的 FACES 格式图像文件诱使目标用户打开，当用户使用受影响版本的 xloadimage 查看该图像时，攻击者即可在目标系统上执行任意代码，进而完全控制该 Linux 系统。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0775"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:56Z","remediation":"xloadimage 4.1 及同版本的 xli（1.16 和 1.17）均受此缓冲区溢出漏洞影响，应立即升级至修复版本：Gentoo 用户执行 emerge --ask --oneshot --verbose \">=media-gfx/xloadimage-4.1-r2\" 和 emerge --ask --oneshot --verbose \">=media-gfx/xli-1.17.0-r1\"；Debian 用户根据 DSA-069 和 DSA-695 使用 apt-get upgrade 更新 xloadimage 或 xli 软件包；Red Hat 用户安装 RHSA-2001-088 安全补丁。如暂无法升级，可临时禁用或卸载 xloadimage/xli 工具，避免向受信来源之外打开 FACES 格式图像文件，以缓解远程任意代码执行风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-069","http://www.debian.org/security/2005/dsa-695","http://www.gentoo.org/security/en/glsa/glsa-200503-05.xml","http://www.iss.net/security_center/static/6821.php","http://www.novell.com/linux/security/advisories/2001_024_xli_txt.html","http://www.redhat.com/support/errata/RHSA-2001-088.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/195823","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/3006","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20998","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2191d577d2d643f301487a89dd6359b1113a07b9/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0775.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0775","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/1bcfc51649d76497fa60b30641a1d994609c3c9a/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0775.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/80dda50d8d5f7811125252929942fe793daf4c0a/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0775.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/retired/CVE-2001-0775","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/gentoo_GLSA-200503-05.nasl","https://github.com/illuusio/freebsd-osv/blob/3234f9e67d0170ff9c6cada9a1f48f061b109728/md/2005/FreeBSD-2005-0167.md","https://github.com/jdkoftinoff/mb-linux-msli/blob/8adb103e34af9ff1d8d122e9ee2a1808836f0a14/uClinux-dist/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-069.nasl","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--5950ade4-e232-4840-b701-78923241f385.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/00e659cc26706b4c8226b428a4b2efed81556ef0/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2001-0775"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0107.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2001-0105","file_name":"2001/AVE-2001-0105.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2001-0735","title":"cfingerd cfingerd 1.4.1/1.4.2/1.4.3 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"cfingerd 是一个安全的 finger 守护进程实现，在 1.4.1 至 1.4.3 版本中存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。当启用 ALLOW_LINE_PARSING 配置选项时（该选项默认开启），守护进程在解析用户家目录下的 .nofinger 文件时会逐行读取内容。由于缺乏对输入行长度的充分验证，攻击者可在 .nofinger 文件中写入超长行内容，触发栈缓冲区溢出并覆盖返回地址，从而在上下文中执行任意代码。由于 cfingerd 通常由 inetd 以 root 权限调用，且官方文档甚至鼓励这样配置，因此该漏洞可导致本地普通用户直接获得 root 权限。该漏洞影响 1.4.3 及所有更早版本，在 Red Hat Linux 6.2 及多个 Linux 发行版上均有利用代码验证。CVSS v2 评分 7.2，攻击向量为本地，无需身份认证即可利用。利用方式为在 .nofinger 文件中植入包含 shellcode 的超长行，覆盖函数返回地址指向 shellcode，再通过本地 finger 服务（端口 79）触发代码执行获取 root shell。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2001-0735"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"2001-10-18T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:54:51Z","remediation":"升级到 cfingerd 1.5 或更高版本，该版本修复了缓冲区溢出漏洞；禁用 .nofinger 文件中的 ALLOW_LINE_PARSING 选项或限制其解析长度；验证所有输入的 .nofinger 文件行长度，并确保其大于缓冲区大小；如无法立即升级，建议使用 chroot  jails 或其他访问控制机制限制对 cfingerd 的本地访问权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-24T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.debian.org/security/2001/dsa-066","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/01071120191900.00788%40localhost.localdomain","http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/192844","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2914","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/6744","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20964","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/67d48875bcd35ab339290b9a99c435b09bd5c40b/cves/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0735.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-2001/CVE-2001-0735","https://github.com/HORKimhab/poc-cve-collection/blob/f7d503345a02e01eaaf915c0e3939c46f947a88c/2001/0xxx/CVE-2001-0735.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/dc46d37c28bb275abd05bf31414b33cf4107e07c/CVE/data/2001/CVE-2001-0735.json","https://github.com/zercurity/vulnerabilities/blob/8eb5f158d91688a46557263c708774d5f8d3956c/2001/CVE-2001-0735","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/2b8a7bdd977d852aa4b7aade01f4fcd4d623cfde/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-j7gx-9mq3-49g8/GHSA-j7gx-9mq3-49g8.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/nessus/nessus-plugins/scripts/debian_DSA-066.nasl","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/4731f60845c8f35e2bdb03d333a9e9d84c7b1c27/content/CVE-2001-0735.md","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_151600_151700.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2001/AVE-2001-0105.toml"}]